  "description": "Selection 'U' on row 1: the WHEN 'U' arm at :190-199. The EVALUATE TRUE at :151-185 scans SEL0001I through SEL0010I in that order and the first non-blank cell wins, so row 1's tick moves 'U' into CDEMO-CU00-USR-SEL-FLG and USRID01I into CDEMO-CU00-USR-SELECTED. Both are non-blank, so the guard at :187-188 admits the transfer: :192-195 stamp COUSR02C, CU00, COUSR00C and a zero program context, and the XCTL at :196-199 hands over. PROCESS-ENTER-KEY therefore returns before :218, so no browse is opened and no map is sent - the page-forward that normally follows a tick never runs. The routing is a response field and not a server-side forward (gate G40), and the identifier it carries travels in the payload rather than in a session (gate G37).",
